# Messages
msgid "No PDC account mapping found for Bank Account {0} in Treasury Company Settings {1}."
msgstr "No cheque account mapping found for Bank Account {0} in Treasury Company Settings {1}."

msgid "Cheque No {0} is used by a PDC Cheque or a Security Cheque. Cancel that cheque instead."
msgstr "Cheque No {0} is used by a Cheque or a Security Cheque. Cancel that cheque instead."

msgid "Cheque No {0} is used by a PDC Cheque or a Security Cheque. Cancel or replace that cheque instead."
msgstr "Cheque No {0} is used by a Cheque or a Security Cheque. Cancel or replace that cheque instead."

msgid "PDC scheduled party posting failed for cheque {0}"
msgstr "Scheduled party posting failed for cheque {0}"

msgid "PDC due alert email could not be sent"
msgstr "Cheque due alert email could not be sent"

msgid "You are not permitted to use the PDC Bank Clearing tool."
msgstr "You are not permitted to use the Cheque Bank Clearing tool."

msgid "PDC Bank Clearing failed for cheque {0}"
msgstr "Cheque Bank Clearing failed for cheque {0}"

msgid "PDC Bank Clearing failed for Bank Transfer {0}"
msgstr "Cheque Bank Clearing failed for Bank Transfer {0}"

msgid "PDC Bank Clearing failed for Bank Transaction {0}"
msgstr "Cheque Bank Clearing failed for Bank Transaction {0}"

msgid "Open in PDC Register"
msgstr "Open in Cheque Register"

msgid "Open in PDC Register (all bank accounts: approximate)"
msgstr "Open in Cheque Register (all bank accounts: approximate)"

msgid "Open PDC Bank Clearing"
msgstr "Open Cheque Bank Clearing"

msgid "Cheques in PDC Register"
msgstr "Cheques in Cheque Register"

msgid "You need permission to create PDC Cheques to submit a Cheque Batch."
msgstr "You need permission to create Cheques to submit a Cheque Batch."

msgid "You need permission to create PDC Cheques or Cheque Batches to add a payee."
msgstr "You need permission to create Cheques or Cheque Batches to add a payee."

msgid "Vouchers of the PDC Cheque {0}"
msgstr "Vouchers of the Cheque {0}"

msgid "{0} {1} needs a row in PDC Accounts."
msgstr "{0} {1} needs a row in Cheque Accounts."

msgid "Every company bank account needs its PDC accounts (payable, receivable, under collection)."
msgstr "Every company bank account needs its cheque accounts (payable, receivable, under collection)."

msgid "the PDC Account Mapping format"
msgstr "the Cheque Account Mapping format"

msgid "A guarantee cheque held from a party (incoming) or given to a party (outgoing). It never creates accounting entries; only its encashment, through a PDC Cheque, does."
msgstr "A guarantee cheque held from a party (incoming) or given to a party (outgoing). It never creates accounting entries; only its encashment, through a Cheque, does."

msgid "A PDC Cheque is created for the encashment and posted per Treasury Company Settings. The security cheque itself never posts."
msgstr "A Cheque is created for the encashment and posted per Treasury Company Settings. The security cheque itself never posts."

msgid "Only a security cheque of a party (Customer, Supplier, Employee …) can be encashed through a PDC Cheque; this one is of {0}."
msgstr "Only a security cheque of a party (Customer, Supplier, Employee …) can be encashed through a Cheque; this one is of {0}."

msgid "Incoming cheques Received and posted to the party (in PDC Receivable), due after the discount date, in the facility currency."
msgstr "Incoming cheques Received and posted to the party (in Cheques Receivable), due after the discount date, in the facility currency."

msgid "Cheque {0} must be posted to the party (in PDC Receivable) before it can be discounted; it is {1}."
msgstr "Cheque {0} must be posted to the party (in Cheques Receivable) before it can be discounted; it is {1}."

msgid "Default: the Bank Charges Account of the bank in PDC Accounts, else the Bounce Charges Account."
msgstr "Default: the Bank Charges Account of the bank in Cheque Accounts, else the Bounce Charges Account."

msgid "A kind of bank charge (account maintenance, cheque book, SMS alerts ...), with its expense account per company and the statement keywords that propose it in PDC Bank Clearing."
msgstr "A kind of bank charge (account maintenance, cheque book, SMS alerts ...), with its expense account per company and the statement keywords that propose it in Cheque Bank Clearing."

msgid "Statement lines matched by keyword are selected for creation in PDC Bank Clearing."
msgstr "Statement lines matched by keyword are selected for creation in Cheque Bank Clearing."

msgid "No keywords: this category is never proposed by PDC Bank Clearing."
msgstr "No keywords: this category is never proposed by Cheque Bank Clearing."

msgid "New bank charges stay uncleared until they are matched in PDC Bank Clearing."
msgstr "New bank charges stay uncleared until they are matched in Cheque Bank Clearing."

msgid "It stays open until it is matched with the bank statement (PDC Bank Clearing)."
msgstr "It stays open until it is matched with the bank statement (Cheque Bank Clearing)."

msgid "Tip: PDC Bank Clearing completes transfers from the bank statement automatically."
msgstr "Tip: Cheque Bank Clearing completes transfers from the bank statement automatically."

msgid "Auto Debit drawdowns: the daily job posts each installment on its due date, or the installment is posted when matched with the bank statement line in PDC Bank Clearing."
msgstr "Auto Debit drawdowns: the daily job posts each installment on its due date, or the installment is posted when matched with the bank statement line in Cheque Bank Clearing."

msgid "The bank debits each installment automatically. Import the bank statement and match it in PDC Bank Clearing to post the repayment."
msgstr "The bank debits each installment automatically. Import the bank statement and match it in Cheque Bank Clearing to post the repayment."

msgid "An installment cheque to the lender of this drawdown (PDC to Lender): its party posting is the repayment of the installment."
msgstr "An installment cheque to the lender of this drawdown (Cheques to Lender): its party posting is the repayment of the installment."

msgid "Auto Debit: the bank debits each installment (Treasury Company Settings: Auto Debit Posting). PDC to Lender: one post-dated cheque per installment (Generate Installment Cheques)."
msgstr "Auto Debit: the bank debits each installment (Treasury Company Settings: Auto Debit Posting). Cheques to Lender: one post-dated cheque per installment (Generate Installment Cheques)."

msgid "Bank: entered by a user. Auto Debit: debited by the bank (daily job or bank statement). PDC Cheque: the party posting of an installment cheque to the lender."
msgstr "Bank: entered by a user. Auto Debit: debited by the bank (daily job or bank statement). Cheque: the party posting of an installment cheque to the lender."

msgid "PDC to Lender · {0} of {1} cheques"
msgstr "Cheques to Lender · {0} of {1} cheques"
